Oh, hey, apparently lojban-beginners@yahoogroups.com was a thing.

There was also a jbofihe@yahoogroups.com , but I doubt anyone cares
about the content there anymore (it was specifically about jbofihe
the software).

There is, arguably, also loccan3@yahoogroups.com .  There were a
bunch of other conlang yahoogroups I see people referencing, if
anyone wants to try to grab those too:

- engelang@yahoogroups.com
- auxlang-dialog@yahoogroups.com
- langdev@yahoogroups.com

Also, apparently our lists are at http://mail.lojban.org/ ; how
clever of past me.  :D

